1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:04,195
With great purchases come great responsibilities.

2
00:00:05,050 --> 00:00:06,960
Mostly keeping receipts.

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:11,441
Cycle complete!

4
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:12,463
What?

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:13,900
Cycle complete!

6
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,009
For best results, download the LexCorp app.

7
00:00:16,150 --> 00:00:17,152
Are you kidding me?

8
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,791
Thank you for choosing LexCorp!

9
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:24,379
Whoa, Lois. Step away from the spin cycle.

10
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:29,630
If you've got the receipt, Sueperman can check whether LexCorp owes you a remedy.

11
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:36,716
People miss recalls. They miss settlements. Sometimes they don't even know there's anything to claim.

12
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:45,349
Meet Sueperman. Your consumer-rights agent.

13
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,665
It checks your purchases against official recall notices.

14
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:57,220
Checks the details, and rejects false matches.

15
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,754
And helps prepare the paperwork, with the evidence to back it up.

16
00:01:09,650 --> 00:01:11,547
Wait. Are you Superman?

17
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:12,570
No.

18
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,012
Can you fix my washing machine?

19
00:01:16,450 --> 00:01:16,920
No.

20
00:01:19,250 --> 00:01:22,589
But I know how to get the paperwork started.